  "content": "<p data-pid=\"cPxWkqBD\">为了回答这个问题，我翻了一下自己的库，发现有点难绷。。。</p><p data-pid=\"0smrWtHe\">我怎么不知道我库里有这么多部百合 gal 游戏（</p><p data-pid=\"ARW3ZZ6b\">以下百合 gal 分为我玩过的和没玩过的，只评价玩过的。不一定剧情都优秀，有的剧情可能还是屎，我的评价完全根据模糊的印象，不保证 100% 准确。顺序不代表排名，只代表我翻库找作品的顺序。</p><h2>玩过的</h2><h3>Sea Bed</h3><p data-pid=\"NtK8q-8b\">首先肯定少不了我知乎头像的出处——Sea Bed——少数几部把我玩得很惆怅的作品之一。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-c2e727efb2155354e824eb40b7d253b4_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-c2e727efb2155354e824eb40b7d253b4\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-c2e727efb2155354e824eb40b7d253b4_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1972&#39; height=&#39;780&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-c2e727efb2155354e824eb40b7d253b4\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-c2e727efb2155354e824eb40b7d253b4_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-c2e727efb2155354e824eb40b7d253b4_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h3>始于谎言的夏日恋情</h3><p data-pid=\"IKSKqrHN\">通过这部作品认识的 Akeo 老师（剧本）和塩こうじ老师（原画）。在这部作品里你能体验到师生、青梅、天降、日本人奇异伦理观（涉及家暴、出轨）等等。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-cb2512cca315ee51fb4b9f1c1a72b18a_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-cb2512cca315ee51fb4b9f1c1a72b18a\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-cb2512cca315ee51fb4b9f1c1a72b18a_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1972&#39; height=&#39;780&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-cb2512cca315ee51fb4b9f1c1a72b18a\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-cb2512cca315ee51fb4b9f1c1a72b18a_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-cb2512cca315ee51fb4b9f1c1a72b18a_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h3>提早绽放的黑百合</h3><p data-pid=\"XNDReS-o\">这部是反过来，我是冲着原画<span class=\"nolink\">フカヒレ</span>老师来的，玩法有点坐牢，本人不擅长推理，不看攻略还真过不去（</p><p data-pid=\"Gs1r8Lpr\">剧情有悬疑要素，作者还有点想要讨论社会话题的野心，但是。。。还是多发点糖吧。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-80d10b8f89af1044d99e2bed3e77d70a_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-80d10b8f89af1044d99e2bed3e77d70a\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-80d10b8f89af1044d99e2bed3e77d70a_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1972&#39; height=&#39;780&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-80d10b8f89af1044d99e2bed3e77d70a\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-80d10b8f89af1044d99e2bed3e77d70a_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-80d10b8f89af1044d99e2bed3e77d70a_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h3>鼓手余命十日谭</h3><p data-pid=\"B9JNr_D6\">MyGO!!!!! 的粉丝快去玩！免费！超高质量的同人作品！立希 X ALL！剧情完爆柿本广大好吧。提他感觉是侮辱剧本里。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-941393079ad7587269d6c0f84027bd85_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-941393079ad7587269d6c0f84027bd85\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-941393079ad7587269d6c0f84027bd85_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1972&#39; height=&#39;780&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-941393079ad7587269d6c0f84027bd85\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-941393079ad7587269d6c0f84027bd85_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-941393079ad7587269d6c0f84027bd85_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h3>魔法少女的魔女审判</h3><p data-pid=\"U8NXrnHR\">双女主+误会解除反转真的很有冲击力，而且 CP 好多对，磕，都可以磕。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-c4eeaef207b5d39ded30dc75722dc2b4_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-c4eeaef207b5d39ded30dc75722dc2b4\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-c4eeaef207b5d39ded30dc75722dc2b4_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1972&#39; height=&#39;780&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-c4eeaef207b5d39ded30dc75722dc2b4\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-c4eeaef207b5d39ded30dc75722dc2b4_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-c4eeaef207b5d39ded30dc75722dc2b4_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h3>恋语 Juliamo -amrilata lingvo-</h3><p data-pid=\"C82Z980g\">你说的对，但《恋语》是一款百合语学习软件（bushi</p><p data-pid=\"YPMZ6NrP\">没学完，我逃课了（</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-1e8251b13e79aab3a80792faee534dda_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-1e8251b13e79aab3a80792faee534dda\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-1e8251b13e79aab3a80792faee534dda_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1972&#39; height=&#39;780&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-1e8251b13e79aab3a80792faee534dda\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-1e8251b13e79aab3a80792faee534dda_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-1e8251b13e79aab3a80792faee534dda_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h3>梦灯花</h3><p data-pid=\"u1eL8Mcr\">弹幕射击玩家狂喜（bushi</p><p data-pid=\"ZvLOqUra\">剧情也挺长（前期有点水）的，还有多结局，高潮部分很有史诗感。</p><p data-pid=\"WDsV9T8L\">就是有时候卡关需要花时间研究战术和 buff 搭配。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-0d97b619041dae1433720acd300c0e70_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-0d97b619041dae1433720acd300c0e70\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-0d97b619041dae1433720acd300c0e70_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1972&#39; height=&#39;780&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-0d97b619041dae1433720acd300c0e70\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-0d97b619041dae1433720acd300c0e70_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-0d97b619041dae1433720acd300c0e70_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h3>不恋爱就完蛋了</h3><p data-pid=\"OQKGPmiD\">冲着扭曲去的，玩了上司线和学姐线的 HE/BE，没有宣传的那么扭曲、狗血（可能也只是我阈值太高了）。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-ecdcd7dabafea239c97101438dd43bee_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-ecdcd7dabafea239c97101438dd43bee\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-ecdcd7dabafea239c97101438dd43bee_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1972&#39; height=&#39;780&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-ecdcd7dabafea239c97101438dd43bee\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-ecdcd7dabafea239c97101438dd43bee_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-ecdcd7dabafea239c97101438dd43bee_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h3>黄金百合</h3><p data-pid=\"fk-lh2_q\">小甜饼，视角切换太多有点晕。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-7aa131461e66a00de4d3f672ed1014ba_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-7aa131461e66a00de4d3f672ed1014ba\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-7aa131461e66a00de4d3f672ed1014ba_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1972&#39; height=&#39;780&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-7aa131461e66a00de4d3f672ed1014ba\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-7aa131461e66a00de4d3f672ed1014ba_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-7aa131461e66a00de4d3f672ed1014ba_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h3>君羽</h3><p data-pid=\"r7gvdqQ0\">小甜饼，三个人凑三对 CP，笑死。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-8c1556b6bc45c70bdf0fdb6982c36784_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-8c1556b6bc45c70bdf0fdb6982c36784\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-8c1556b6bc45c70bdf0fdb6982c36784_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1972&#39; height=&#39;780&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-8c1556b6bc45c70bdf0fdb6982c36784\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-8c1556b6bc45c70bdf0fdb6982c36784_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-8c1556b6bc45c70bdf0fdb6982c36784_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h3>一生推不如一生恋</h3><p data-pid=\"a3rYMtg3\">别惦记你那小兵卫了。脚本难道觉得抽卡角色比女朋友重要是种卖点吗？</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-8f6132d4fa950cd1dce6cc5c3fa57a77_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-8f6132d4fa950cd1dce6cc5c3fa57a77\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-8f6132d4fa950cd1dce6cc5c3fa57a77_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1972&#39; height=&#39;780&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-8f6132d4fa950cd1dce6cc5c3fa57a77\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-8f6132d4fa950cd1dce6cc5c3fa57a77_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-8f6132d4fa950cd1dce6cc5c3fa57a77_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h3>花开公路</h3><p data-pid=\"i-V02f0k\">百合美式公路片，还挺新鲜。后期矛盾有点突兀。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-35891182076184c43926aae17d142d5c_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-35891182076184c43926aae17d142d5c\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-35891182076184c43926aae17d142d5c_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1972&#39; height=&#39;780&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-35891182076184c43926aae17d142d5c\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-35891182076184c43926aae17d142d5c_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-35891182076184c43926aae17d142d5c_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h3>彷徨之街</h3><p data-pid=\"GQ7LCmkg\">剧情。。。有些对话真得尬得抠脚。没打完。感觉时间被浪费了。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-207941921f8ef8b2c370fb430b4cd1c2_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-207941921f8ef8b2c370fb430b4cd1c2\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-207941921f8ef8b2c370fb430b4cd1c2_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1972&#39; height=&#39;780&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-207941921f8ef8b2c370fb430b4cd1c2\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-207941921f8ef8b2c370fb430b4cd1c2_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-207941921f8ef8b2c370fb430b4cd1c2_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h3>fault</h3><p data-pid=\"1NyCaFnJ\">煽情。但是确实把我眼泪骗到了。世界观很大，系列作，填坑得有生之年了。护卫姐姐好帅。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-cc136d36a781d14bdf0998411b8d7918_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-cc136d36a781d14bdf0998411b8d7918\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-cc136d36a781d14bdf0998411b8d7918_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1972&#39; height=&#39;780&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-cc136d36a781d14bdf0998411b8d7918\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-cc136d36a781d14bdf0998411b8d7918_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-cc136d36a781d14bdf0998411b8d7918_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h3>flowers</h3><p data-pid=\"HjxWQXLk\">我只玩了春、夏、秋，由于我对第一部主角团不太感冒，所以没有玩冬。个人比较喜欢夏和秋。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-a84b0cae663e88f99616cc10633ab146_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-a84b0cae663e88f99616cc10633ab146\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-a84b0cae663e88f99616cc10633ab146_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1972&#39; height=&#39;780&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-a84b0cae663e88f99616cc10633ab146\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-a84b0cae663e88f99616cc10633ab146_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-a84b0cae663e88f99616cc10633ab146_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-7f079026a9f63143b8a5b3bca62cac47_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-7f079026a9f63143b8a5b3bca62cac47\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-7f079026a9f63143b8a5b3bca62cac47_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1972&#39; height=&#39;780&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-7f079026a9f63143b8a5b3bca62cac47\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-7f079026a9f63143b8a5b3bca62cac47_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-7f079026a9f63143b8a5b3bca62cac47_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-90e79e928c7b6ef8e7ab1a4e63601369_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-90e79e928c7b6ef8e7ab1a4e63601369\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-90e79e928c7b6ef8e7ab1a4e63601369_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1972&#39; height=&#39;780&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-90e79e928c7b6ef8e7ab1a4e63601369\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-90e79e928c7b6ef8e7ab1a4e63601369_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-90e79e928c7b6ef8e7ab1a4e63601369_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h3>聆花百合系列</h3><p data-pid=\"nxtPv33x\">可能是我玩的第一部国 G？我个人最喜欢《千面》，反差感实在过于有趣。身份揭穿后的情绪起伏把握也恰到好处。现在的 B 站头像也是眠雪。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-030673e190a96756be2791abc3b6ad34_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-030673e190a96756be2791abc3b6ad34\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-030673e190a96756be2791abc3b6ad34_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1972&#39; height=&#39;780&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-030673e190a96756be2791abc3b6ad34\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-030673e190a96756be2791abc3b6ad34_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-030673e190a96756be2791abc3b6ad34_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-cb38762cd8742355c476d802dcb91901_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-cb38762cd8742355c476d802dcb91901\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-cb38762cd8742355c476d802dcb91901_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1972&#39; height=&#39;780&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-cb38762cd8742355c476d802dcb91901\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-cb38762cd8742355c476d802dcb91901_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-cb38762cd8742355c476d802dcb91901_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-48f8d297f10f766a4a4684f22cadea34_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-48f8d297f10f766a4a4684f22cadea34\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-48f8d297f10f766a4a4684f22cadea34_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1972&#39; height=&#39;780&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-48f8d297f10f766a4a4684f22cadea34\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-48f8d297f10f766a4a4684f22cadea34_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-48f8d297f10f766a4a4684f22cadea34_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-680dfa20ae55a67b46337547ef701ec2_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-680dfa20ae55a67b46337547ef701ec2\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-680dfa20ae55a67b46337547ef701ec2_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1972&#39; height=&#39;780&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-680dfa20ae55a67b46337547ef701ec2\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-680dfa20ae55a67b46337547ef701ec2_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-680dfa20ae55a67b46337547ef701ec2_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-e51fafcada5ce26f88ceedf05ff76b1e_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-e51fafcada5ce26f88ceedf05ff76b1e\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-e51fafcada5ce26f88ceedf05ff76b1e_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1972&#39; height=&#39;780&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-e51fafcada5ce26f88ceedf05ff76b1e\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-e51fafcada5ce26f88ceedf05ff76b1e_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-e51fafcada5ce26f88ceedf05ff76b1e_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h2>还没玩过的</h2><h3>天作之合的我们</h3><p data-pid=\"GJ5YVUxy\">都要出第二部了，我第一部还没打（</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-e9a3d87051b4278abafd4da3bc964af5_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-e9a3d87051b4278abafd4da3bc964af5\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-e9a3d87051b4278abafd4da3bc964af5_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1972&#39; height=&#39;780&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-e9a3d87051b4278abafd4da3bc964af5\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-e9a3d87051b4278abafd4da3bc964af5_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-e9a3d87051b4278abafd4da3bc964af5_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h3>茜色</h3><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-4fc18e7b6c8c7810599c0b71d4870083_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-4fc18e7b6c8c7810599c0b71d4870083\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-4fc18e7b6c8c7810599c0b71d4870083_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1972&#39; height=&#39;780&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-4fc18e7b6c8c7810599c0b71d4870083\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-4fc18e7b6c8c7810599c0b71d4870083_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-4fc18e7b6c8c7810599c0b71d4870083_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h3>仅你一人</h3><p data-pid=\"R4UGFcxz\">听说有病娇</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-d30aae7c0263c728e2c68c8489ab29c2_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-d30aae7c0263c728e2c68c8489ab29c2\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-d30aae7c0263c728e2c68c8489ab29c2_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1972&#39; height=&#39;780&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-d30aae7c0263c728e2c68c8489ab29c2\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-d30aae7c0263c728e2c68c8489ab29c2_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-d30aae7c0263c728e2c68c8489ab29c2_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h3>伦敦旧影</h3><p data-pid=\"cJfBpnLA\">在广橘 only 上被安利的。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-546527ecb18a0bddffc0e0a1d2f5e621_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1972\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-546527ecb18a0bddffc0e0a1d2f5e621\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1972\" data-original=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-546527ecb18a0bddffc0e0a1d2f5e621_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://ww